{"ID":"20240515131425-63z0tr5","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131425-63z0tr5","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131425-63z0tr5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515134823-rded7b7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515134823-rded7b7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515134823-rded7b7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:320,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:320\u0026#125;","title":"044","type":"doc","updated":"20240515134823"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515134823-rded7b7","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 822px;","id":"20240515134823-rded7b7","updated":"20240515134823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"FR"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"M"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"約六十歲 , 中等高身壯"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/29"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一天撞車, 胸受損, 很痛 (現無痛了)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二天又去看牙醫, 注射 Novocaine (麻醉劑)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第三天又正好是FAA檢查身體,  發現心律不整."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 睡眠不好, 因兩三次小便"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 大便每日行"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 小便深褐色"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 口渴有 喜冷飲"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 胃口好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. 雙足冷"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左手脈時一止, 右手脈還好"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃濕"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有一點心律不整"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1) 炙甘草 五錢  桂枝五錢  生薑兩片  大棗十枚  熟地兩錢  黨參三錢  麻仁二錢 阿膠三錢 (分三包)  細辛二錢  烏藥五錢  炮附子三錢  黃連二錢  黃芩二錢  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三付  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮成三碗 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前吃"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2) 服完湯藥之後,  因工作之故, 可服囊劑,  共400 caps, 每日三次 , 每次八粒,    飯前服用."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病家是航空公司機長, 每年須通過FAA體檢"}]}]}]}]}